WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.018
A synthetic support form. Form Rescue isn't enabled here yet.

2
00:00:03.018 --> 00:00:06.284
Enable protection for this site — access to this one site only.

3
00:00:06.284 --> 00:00:12.220
Write as usual.

4
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.429
About a second after a pause, the draft is committed to this browser.

5
00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:16.873
The page refreshes — and the text is gone.

6
00:00:16.873 --> 00:00:18.571
Form Rescue has a saved draft for this page.

7
00:00:18.571 --> 00:00:20.143
Review drafts opens a page the website can't see.

8
00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:23.080
Compare what was saved with what's on the page, and choose what to restore.

9
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.098
Nothing is restored until you confirm.

10
00:00:25.098 --> 00:00:27.712
Your words are back.
